      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Dramatic Return",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "A destroyed theater phantasm slowly reforms to full strength over the course of 1 week. The only way to permanently destroy the phantasm is to reduce it to 0 Hit Points during a performance occurring in its bonded theater."
