      "name": "Spotlight",
      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "emotion",
        "light",
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\n\nEffect The theater phantasm draws attention to a creature it admires. The phantasm designates a target other than itself within 50 feet with a subtle spotlight, giving the target a +2 status bonus to Performance checks and resistance 10 to mental damage for 1 minute. If it uses this ability again on a new target, the former creature loses its spotlight.\n\nEffect: Spotlight",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
      }
    }
  ],
  "text": "Theater phantasms are amalgamations of the spiritual and emotional energy given up by entertainers and audiences of powerful performances."
